1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Project_Nemesis\" title=\"Project Nemesis\">Project Nemesis</a></b>, End chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Insightful Constitution +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Insightful Constitution +6</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Quality Constitution +3</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Quality Constitution +3</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +3 <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Soundproof\" title=\"Soundproof\">Soundproof</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Soundproof\" title=\"Soundproof\">Soundproof</a>:</b> Protects against <a href=\"/page/Stunned\" title=\"Stunned\">stunning</a>, <a href=\"/page/Dazed\" title=\"Dazed\">dazing</a> and <a href=\"/page/Disoriented\" title=\"Disoriented\">disorientation</a> from sound-based spells such as <a href=\"/page/Soundburst\" title=\"Soundburst\">Soundburst</a> and <a href=\"/page/Greater_Shout\" title=\"Greater Shout\">Greater Shout</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Alchemical_Conservation\" title=\"Alchemical Conservation\">Alchemical Conservation</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Alchemical_Conservation\" title=\"Alchemical Conservation\">Alchemical Conservation</a>:</b> This item modifies the user's energy expenditure in such a way that many abilities can be used more frequently than normal. You will gain +1 <a href=\"/page/Ki\" title=\"Ki\">ki</a> on every successful attack, and you will increase the number of <a href=\"/page/Action_Boost\" title=\"Action Boost\">Action Boosts</a>, <a href=\"/page/Turn_Undead\" title=\"Turn Undead\">Turn Undead</a> attempts, and <a href=\"/page/Bard_song\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bard song\">Bard Songs</a> you can use per rest by 1 each.